+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+This project previously decided to switch its transport compression codec from gzip to zstd, but that decision was subsequently revoked (`config/decisions/revoke-compression.json`), and no replacement codec has been recorded since. As a result, there is currently no recorded decision on which transport compression codec this project uses.
